sequenceDiagram
  participant S as Seller system
  participant G as API gateway
  participant I as Invoice service
  participant R as Rules service
  participant D as Transaction DB
  participant O as Outbox / broker
  participant M as Matching service
  participant A as Audit and analytics

  S->>G: POST invoice + idempotency key
  G->>I: authenticated canonical request
  I->>R: validate taxpayers, invoice and effective rules
  R-->>I: calculation and rule evidence
  I->>D: commit invoice, VAT transaction, ledger and outbox atomically
  D-->>I: committed transaction ID
  I-->>G: signed certification receipt
  G-->>S: 201 Certified
  D->>O: publish committed outbox events
  O->>M: InvoiceCertified / VATPosted
  O->>A: audit, risk and analytical events
  M-->>O: MatchResolved or ExceptionOpened

